menu "configure qrcode"

    config ENABLE_QRCODE
        bool "ENABLE_QRCODE: QR code output for Tuya APP binding"
        default n
        help
            Build the qrcode module (qrcodegen + qrencode_print) in
            core-common/common/qrcode and activate the QR printing blocks
            in demos (wired binding prints the pairing QR this way).
            Maps to the CMake switch CONFIG_ENABLE_QRCODE.

endmenu
